flowchart TB
  subgraph data[Dataset and patient grouping]
    A[NIH/NLM segmented cell images] --> C[Image file index]
    B[Official patient-to-cell maps] --> C
    C --> D[Patient-grouped 70 / 15 / 15 split]
  end
  subgraph model[Training and evaluation]
    D --> E[Train cells: 96 × 96 RGB + geometric augmentation]
    D --> F[Validation cells: no augmentation]
    D --> G[Held-out patient test cells]
    E --> H[Custom CNN: conv blocks 32 / 64 / 128]
    F --> J[Validation loss selects checkpoint]
    J -. early stopping and selection .-> H
    H --> K[Saved best checkpoint]
    G --> O[Final patient-held-out metrics]
  end
  subgraph demo[Local browser demo]
    M[One uploaded cell image] --> L[FastAPI in-memory prediction]
    K --> L
    L --> N[Class + uncalibrated scores]
  end
